OL,3,A9/11 victims remembered 25 years on
OL,4,Afrom attacks
OL,5,
OL,6,FMemorial services will be held today to
OL,7,Fmark the 25th anniversary of the 9/11
OL,8,Fattacks in the United States
OL,10,FOn 11 September 2001, 2,977 people were
OL,11,Fkilled when hijackers crashed two
OL,12,Fplanes into the Twin Towers of the
OL,13,FWorld Trade Center in New York
OL,15,FAnother hijacked plane hit the Pentagon
OL,16,Fnear Washington DC. A fourth crashed in
OL,17,Fa field in Pennsylvania after
OL,18,Fpassengers fought back
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,312,300,200,140,0,100
